<template><div class="app-container"><h1>微信订阅消息</h1><el-alert :title="data.configured?'微信发送通道已配置，仍需启用模板并由顾客主动订阅。':'发送通道未启用：请在本地环境配置 AppID、AppSecret 和发送开关，再重启服务。此页可以先保存模板。'" :closable="false" :type="data.configured?'success':'info'"/><p>请在微信公众平台申请模板，将实际字段名映射到业务内容。接单、出餐与退款须使用不同模板；每次订阅只发送一次。</p><el-card v-for="t in data.templates" :key="t.event" style="margin:18px 0"><h3>{{names[t.event]}}</h3><el-form label-width="100px"><el-form-item label="模板编号"><el-input v-model="t.template_id" placeholder="微信公众平台模板ID"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="字段映射"><el-input v-model="t.fields_json" type="textarea" :rows="3"/><div class="hint">示例 {"thing1":"store","thing2":"status","time3":"time"}。来源：store 店铺、status 状态、time 时间、amount 金额、order 编号、pickup 取餐码。字段类型须与微信模板一致。</div></el-form-item><el-form-item label="启用模板"><el-switch v-model="t.enabled" :active-value="1" :inactive-value="0"/></el-form-item></el-form><el-button type="primary" :loading="saving===t.event" @click="save(t)">保存配置</el-button></el-card><h3>最近100条通知记录</h3><el-button @click="load">刷新记录</el-button><el-table :data="data.logs"><el-table-column prop="created_at" label="生成时间" min-width="170"/><el-table-column prop="order_id" label="订单" min-width="230"/><el-table-column label="类型"><template #default="{row}">{{names[row.event]}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column label="状态"><template #default="{row}">{{states[row.status]||row.status}}</template></el-table-column><el-table-column prop="attempts" label="尝试次数"/><el-table-column prop="last_error" label="原因" min-width="230"/></el-table><p>发送结果不确定时不会自动重发，避免重复打扰。未配置、未订阅或演示账号的通知会标记为跳过，不影响业务订单。</p></div></template>
<script setup>
import {ref,onMounted} from 'vue';import {foodGet,foodPost} from '@/api/food';import {ElMessage} from 'element-plus';const data=ref({templates:[],logs:[]}),saving=ref('');const names={ACCEPTED:'接单通知',READY:'出餐 / 待取餐',REFUND:'退款结果'},states={PENDING:'待发送',SENDING:'发送中',SENT:'已发送',SKIPPED:'已跳过',FAILED:'发送失败',UNKNOWN:'结果待核对'};async function load(){data.value=(await foodGet('/messages')).data}async function save(t){saving.value=t.event;try{await foodPost('/messages/'+t.event,{templateId:t.template_id,fields:t.fields_json,enabled:!!t.enabled});ElMessage.success('模板配置已保存')}finally{saving.value=''}}onMounted(load)
</script><style scoped>p,.hint{color:#7a8874;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}</style>
